{"id":"ca8848fb75eec21c","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-frege-system.md","title":"A Concrete Propositional Frege System","display":"df-frege-system — A Concrete Propositional Frege System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-frege-system","aliases":["28-df-frege-system"],"display":"df-frege-system — A Concrete Propositional Frege System","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §15.3, Frege and Extended Frege; explicit Hilbert presentation","source_printed_pages":"315","source_pdf_pages":"341","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-frege-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-frege-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-frege-system — A Concrete Propositional Frege System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §15.3, Frege and Extended Frege; explicit Hilbert presentation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"315"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"341"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为语法构造层数；命题变量以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 编号；互异构造标签0、1、2分别用于变量、否定与蕴含；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span>、连接词和公式长度由下式有限结构递归构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(F_1,\\ldots,F_s)\\in\\mathcal F^s\">\\(\\pi=(F_1,\\ldots,F_s)\\in\\mathcal F^s\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\ge1\">\\(s\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_F\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prf}_F\">\\(\\operatorname{Prf}_F\\)</span> 为以下集合和关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_0\\coloneqq\\{(0,i):i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\mathcal F_{t+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal F_t\\cup\\{(1,A):A\\in\\mathcal F_t\\}\\cup\\{(2,A,B):A,B\\in\\mathcal F_t\\},\\qquad\\mathcal F\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F_t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F_0\\coloneqq\\{(0,i):i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\mathcal F_{t+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal F_t\\cup\\{(1,A):A\\in\\mathcal F_t\\}\\cup\\{(2,A,B):A,B\\in\\mathcal F_t\\},\\qquad\\mathcal F\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F_t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\coloneqq(1,A),\\qquad(A\\to B)\\coloneqq(2,A,B),\\qquad |(0,i)|\\coloneqq1,\\qquad|\\neg A|\\coloneqq1+|A|,\\qquad|A\\to B|\\coloneqq1+|A|+|B|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A\\coloneqq(1,A),\\qquad(A\\to B)\\coloneqq(2,A,B),\\qquad |(0,i)|\\coloneqq1,\\qquad|\\neg A|\\coloneqq1+|A|,\\qquad|A\\to B|\\coloneqq1+|A|+|B|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_F\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\to(\\beta\\to\\alpha),\\ (\\alpha\\to(\\beta\\to\\gamma))\\to((\\alpha\\to\\beta)\\to(\\alpha\\to\\gamma)),\\ (\\neg\\beta\\to\\neg\\alpha)\\to(\\alpha\\to\\beta):\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathcal F\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ax}_F\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\to(\\beta\\to\\alpha),\\ (\\alpha\\to(\\beta\\to\\gamma))\\to((\\alpha\\to\\beta)\\to(\\alpha\\to\\gamma)),\\ (\\neg\\beta\\to\\neg\\alpha)\\to(\\alpha\\to\\beta):\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathcal F\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prf}_F(\\pi,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow F_s=\\varphi\\land\\forall i\\in[s]\\ [F_i\\in\\operatorname{Ax}_F\\lor\\exists j,k\\in[i-1]\\ F_k=(F_j\\to F_i)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Prf}_F(\\pi,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow F_s=\\varphi\\land\\forall i\\in[s]\\ [F_i\\in\\operatorname{Ax}_F\\lor\\exists j,k\\in[i-1]\\ F_k=(F_j\\to F_i)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FSz}(\\pi)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=1}^s|F_i|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FSz}(\\pi)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=1}^s|F_i|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>教材概述有限公理模式和推理规则；这里选一个具体经典Hilbert型Frege实例，不能把本实例的三模式冒称原书指定系统。modus ponens由先前行索引直接表达，规模计公式总符号数。此处不附加尚未证明的Frege下界。</p>\n<p>来源：§15.3, Frege and Extended Frege; explicit Hilbert presentation；印刷页 315；PDF 页 341。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第15章的 A Concrete Propositional Frege System，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>规模约定：每个变元出现按一个语法符号计数；若用二进制变元索引计位长，需另给索引编码成本。本条采用逻辑公式常见的符号数规模，未将无界变量名当免费外部数据算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi=(F_1,\\ldots,F_s)\\in\\mathcal F^s","display":false},{"tex":"s\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prf}_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_0\\coloneqq\\{(0,i):i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\mathcal F_{t+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal F_t\\cup\\{(1,A):A\\in\\mathcal F_t\\}\\cup\\{(2,A,B):A,B\\in\\mathcal F_t\\},\\qquad\\mathcal F\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F_t.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg A\\coloneqq(1,A),\\qquad(A\\to B)\\coloneqq(2,A,B),\\qquad |(0,i)|\\coloneqq1,\\qquad|\\neg A|\\coloneqq1+|A|,\\qquad|A\\to B|\\coloneqq1+|A|+|B|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}_F\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\to(\\beta\\to\\alpha),\\ (\\alpha\\to(\\beta\\to\\gamma))\\to((\\alpha\\to\\beta)\\to(\\alpha\\to\\gamma)),\\ (\\neg\\beta\\to\\neg\\alpha)\\to(\\alpha\\to\\beta):\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathcal F\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prf}_F(\\pi,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow F_s=\\varphi\\land\\forall i\\in[s]\\ [F_i\\in\\operatorname{Ax}_F\\lor\\exists j,k\\in[i-1]\\ F_k=(F_j\\to F_i)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FSz}(\\pi)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=1}^s|F_i|.","display":true}],"bytes":2789,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-351","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-frege-system]]、[[28-thm-craig-propositional-interpolation]]、[[28-thm-resolution-feasible-interpolation]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}